WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.050
Here are the decisions, with
their owners and timing.

2
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:05.067
Before the first partner goes live,

3
00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:09.520
the privacy office determines whether
an existing system-of-records notice

4
00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:14.250
covers partner persons, and the records
officer names the records schedule items.

5
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.700
For each partner, the business
owner decides five things.

6
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.950
Qualifying the partner and approving the
agreement, before any trust is configured.

7
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.619
Which requirements apply,

8
00:00:24.619 --> 00:00:29.400
including the agency's own definition
of partners under M-22-09.

9
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.554
The assurance for each
protected transaction,

10
00:00:32.554 --> 00:00:35.950
with the ISSO and the
application owner consulted.

11
00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:37.840
Any automatic synchronization,

12
00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:41.550
which is an exception on a written
record, with the sponsor named.

13
00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:46.050
And production enablement, with the
authorizing official's consult on record.

14
00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:48.654
A member user type is an exception too,

15
00:00:48.654 --> 00:00:51.763
with its own record,
approver and review date.

16
00:00:51.763 --> 00:00:54.834
The chapter, the partner
identity record and the

17
00:00:54.834 --> 00:00:58.288
Entra profile carry the
detail, every claim footnoted.

18
00:00:58.288 --> 00:00:59.110
Thank you.
